I am using uboot and montavista kernel for our custom MPC8555CDS board.

I enabled the following options in Kernel for kernel Debugging, =
CONFIG_BDI_SWITCH=3Dy CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO=3Dy under kernel hacking and MMU =
XALT in BDI config file. After uboot initialization I fixed break point =
at start_kernel(0xc02784bc), and then I booted the kernel. Without =
breaking  at start_kernel, it came to login prompt. Please find attached =
config file with this mail. Could anybody help me to solve this problem?

Thanks in advance,

Saravanan.S
Bangalore.

